  "item.naraka.sanctuary_compass": "Sanctuary Compass",
  "item.naraka.sanctuary_compass.tooltip.0": "Points toward the nearest 'Herobrine Sanctuary' structure in the current world.",
  "item.naraka.sanctuary_compass.tooltip.1": "The world tends to adjust causality for the sake of its own survival.",
