  "item.naraka.soul_infused_materials.tooltip.0": "Used to charge the 'Soul Stabilizer'.",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_materials.tooltip.1": "An item created by infusing its soul fragments—desperate for color—into minerals that radiate the most vibrant hues.",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_materials.tooltip.2": "The yearning of a soul that craved color has been fulfilled by becoming one with the most vivid radiance.",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_nectarium": "Soul Infused Nectarium",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_nectarium_block": "Block of Soul Infused Nectarium",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_nectarium_sword": "Soul Infused Nectarium Sword",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_redstone": "Soul Infused Redstone",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_redstone_block": "Block of Soul Infused Redstone",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_redstone_sword": "Soul Infused Redstone Sword",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.blessed.tooltip.0": "Blessed equipment resonates, drawing one another in,",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.blessed.tooltip.1": "and when connected through its blood, it will reveal its purest power.",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.blessed.tooltip.longinus": "「Spear of Longinus」",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.blessed.tooltip.longinus.prefix": "Used as a crafting material for the ",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.blessed.tooltip.longinus.suffix": ".",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.tooltip.0": "Holding this sword while wearing all 4 pieces of Purified Soul Armor forged from the same mineral activates the 'Challenger' buff.",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.tooltip.1": "Defeating Herobrine with the 'Challenger' buff active bestows a blessing upon the sword and destroys all equipped armor.",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.tooltip.2": "The challenger must wear the soul stabilized through satisfied craving, wield it as a weapon, and lay to rest to rest the entity that failed to shed its yearning.",
  "item.naraka.soul_infused_swords.tooltip.3": "By doing so, its soul will resonate with the stabilized soul to find peace, and its blessing shall be bestowed upon the weapon held by the challenger.",
  "item.naraka.soul_smithing_block": "Soul Smithing Block",
  "item.naraka.soul_smithing_block.tooltip.0": "After placing, equip a charged Soul Stabilizer and a Smithing Template to forge specific equipment.",
  "item.naraka.soul_smithing_block.tooltip.1": "Forging consumes a certain amount of minerals or God Blood charged in the Soul Stabilizer.",
  "item.naraka.soul_stabilizer": "Soul Stabilizer",
  "item.naraka.soul_stabilizer.tooltip.0": "After placing, right-click with soul-infused minerals or God Blood to charge it.",
  "item.naraka.soul_stabilizer.tooltip.1": "Charging must be done using only one type of item.",
  "item.naraka.spear": "Spear",
  "item.naraka.spear.tooltip.0": "Can be forged at the Smithing Table using Divine Blood and the Soul Smithing Template.",
  "item.naraka.spear.tooltip.1": "A weapon fashioned with its very soul as the blade.",
  "item.naraka.spear.tooltip.2": "Having merely given physical shape to the blade, its power is pitiful;",
  "item.naraka.spear.tooltip.3": "Yet as an offering for a far greater weapon, it could not be more fitting.",
  "item.naraka.spear_of_longinus": "Spear of Longinus",
  "item.naraka.spear_of_longinus.tooltip.0": "Can be thrown, automatically returning to its owner.",
  "item.naraka.spear_of_longinus.tooltip.1": "Instantly kills hit enemies, regardless of the attack method.",
  "item.naraka.spear_of_longinus.tooltip.2": "Eight rests, eight proofs.",
  "item.naraka.spear_of_longinus.tooltip.3": "Your worth is proven, Regicide; the throne of 'Naraka' is now yours.",
  "item.naraka.spear_of_longinus.tooltip.4": "This weapon is the purest power obtained at the end of that journey, and proof that you have been reborn as the sovereign of 'Naraka'.",
